        "created_at": "2014-11-04T09:41:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Apologies if this has come up before.</p><p>Had a game last night where Omnitron-X had some components out and had taken 3 damage in the villain turn. He was healed for 2 points by Tempest during the hero turn, but then took 2 damage in the environment turn. We ruled that since he had taken 5 damage over the course of the turn his components were destroyed. Should he have lost his components?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:48.458Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
