      {
        "id": 120086,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-04T10:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope, it's a turn, not a round.</p><p>The villain, each hero and the environment are separate turns. So anything that references a turn is referring not to one complete go around, but to the individual 'portion' where a single hero, villain or environment act.</p><p>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in just the Villain Turn then it loses it's components.&nbsp;<span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>the Environment Turn&nbsp;</span><span>then it loses it's components.&nbsp;</span><span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>Hero 1's Turn then it loses it's components.&nbsp;</span><span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>Hero 2's Turn then it loses it's components.&nbsp;</span><span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>Hero 3's Turn then it loses it's components. etc etc.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>The healing has no impact on '</span><span>the count' of&nbsp;</span><span>how much damage Omnitron-X takes in a turn.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:53:28.106Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 11486,
        "topic_slug": "omnitron-x-taking-damage",
        "display_username": "Matchstickman",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Nope, it&#39;s a turn, not a round.</p><p>The villain, each hero and the environment are separate turns. So anything that references a turn is referring not to one complete go around, but to the individual &#39;portion&#39; where a single hero, villain or environment act.</p><p>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in just the Villain Turn then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">the Environment Turn&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hero 1&#39;s Turn then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hero 2&#39;s Turn then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hero 3&#39;s Turn then it loses it&#39;s components. etc etc.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">The healing has no impact on &#39;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">the count&#39; of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">how much damage Omnitron-X takes in a turn.</span></p>",
